N5008 [dcl.init.aggr]/3.1 (designators name the explicitly initialized
elements) and /5.1 (the others take their default member initializer), plus
[class.bit] braced default member initializers of bit-fields.  Non-vacuous:
the last assertion is deliberately wrong and must FAIL.  Before the fix:
"last designated"/"two designated" FAILURE (a=0, 7 dropped), and the bit-field
cases aborted the solver ("Reached unimplemented boolbv_widtht::get_entry()").
